{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202602090155547e21e970d79f4798","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll design a unique aesthetic direction for Dra. Isabela Barros. Based on the progress.md, I need to create a completely new palette that's different from all 21 previous palettes. Let me create an **Aurora Noir & Pearl Silver** aesthetic - a luminous, ethereal direction with cool aurora tones, shimmering pearl silver accents, and deep charcoal backgrounds.\n\n**Design Direction for Dra. Isabela Barros:**\n\n**Aesthetic Direction:** Aurora Noir & Pearl Silver\n- A completely new luminous direction from all previous palettes\n- Cool aurora greens/blues (#4A9B8A, #6AB8AA), shimmering pearl silver (#C8C8D8), deep charcoal (#1A1A1A)\n- Aurora wave-shaped border-radius patterns create fluid, ethereal animations reminiscent of northern lights\n- Typography: Playfair Display (display) paired with Plus Jakarta Sans (body)\n\nLet me create the complete site now:"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"2d580528-34aa-4d7c-a124-48e357ef5700","uuid":"af0823c0-777b-4986-a4ea-e75de76472ca"}
