{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_f0d95f267da24f73a82991f0","type":"tool_result","content":"   850→\n   851→## 2026-02-08 - US-067\n   852→- Created complete website for Dr Brunno Rodrigues - Harmonização Facial e Estética Avançada in Ribeirão Preto\n   853→- Files changed:\n   854→  - `site-demo/dr-brunno-rodrigues/index.html` (new)\n   855→- **Design Concept**: Jade Noir & Brushed Gold aesthetic with deep jade greens (#2A6B5A, #3A8B7A, #1A4B3A), warm brushed gold (#B89858, #C8A868, #A88048), and rice paper backgrounds (#FAFAF8, #F5F5F2). A completely new sophisticated direction from all previous 20 palettes (rose/gold, sage/pearl, lavender/mocha, emerald/silk, rose/quartz, amber/bronze, plum/gold, sapphire/champagne, pearl/mink, opal/dusty rose, coral/seafoam, burgundy/gold, porcelain/rouge, chrome/violet, amethyst/platinum, rose gold/champagne diamond, teal/copper, onyx/bronze patina, moss/burnt sienna). Jade stone-shaped border-radius patterns create refined, organic animations reminiscent of carved jade stones.\n   856→- **Typography**: Crimson Pro (display) paired with Manrope (body) for sophisticated elegance with modern readability\n   857→- **Key Features Implemented**:\n   858→  - Animated hero with 4 floating jade stone-shaped backgrounds using gradient meshes\n   859→  - Jade stone border-radius patterns (`--radius-jade-1`, `--radius-jade-2`, `--radius-jade-3`, `--radius-jade-4`) create refined, organic animations\n   860→  - Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n   861→  - Problem/Solution section with hover effects and left border accent\n   862→  - 6 service cards (Harmonização Facial, Toxina Botulínica, Preenchedores Faciais, Preenchimento Labial, Bioestimuladores, Protocolos Exclusivos)\n   863→  - 3 testimonial cards with gradient avatars on jade background\n   864→  - 6 differential items with pulsing icon rings\n   865→  - Contact form with WhatsApp integration (opens pre-filled message)\n   866→  - Responsive design for mobile, tablet, desktop\n   867→  - Intersection Observer animations for scroll-triggered effects\n   868→  - Accessibility: prefers-reduced-motion support, focus styles, semantic HTML\n   869→- **Contact Info**: R. João Penteado, 1545 - Jardim America, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14020-180, Brazil | (16) 99122-0511\n   870→- **Demo URL**: pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dr-brunno-rodrigues\n   871→\n   872→**Learnings**:\n   873→- **Pattern**: Jade Noir & Brushed Gold palette creates a sophisticated, refined aesthetic with masculine elegance that conveys precision and transformation - completely different from all 20 previous palettes\n   874→- **Pattern**: Jade stone border-radius shapes (`68% 32% 52% 48% / 52% 38% 62% 48%`) provide a more refined, organic interpretation of blobmorphism with subtle angular qualities that feel carved and polished\n   875→- **Pattern**: Crimson Pro + Manrope typography pairing combines elegant serif sophistication with modern geometric sans-serif for refined readability\n   876→- **Gotcha**: The jade-gold-rice paper palette feels more sophisticated and masculine while maintaining premium positioning - it evokes feelings of precision, craftsmanship, and Eastern-inspired elegance\n   877→- **Gotcha**: Jade stone-shaped borders create a distinctive refined animation that feels organic and polished without being distracting - different from all previous shape patterns used\n   878→- **Gotcha**: The jade color family (#2A6B5A, #3A8B7A, #1A4B3A) evokes precious carved jade stones - perfect for facial harmonization clinics seeking a sophisticated, masculine brand\n   879→- **Gotcha**: Brushed gold accents (#B89858, #C8A868, #A88048) add metallic quality that complements the cool jade tones perfectly - creates a balanced, sophisticated color harmony\n   880→- **Gotcha**: Rice paper backgrounds (#FAFAF8, #F5F5F2) provide warmth and subtle texture without being as yellow-based as champagne tones, creating a refined foundation\n   881